<title>ITALY: TENNIS-INTERNATIONAL TENNIS RESULTS FROM SICILY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-INTERNATIONAL TENNIS RESULTS FROM SICILY.</headline>
<dateline>PALERMO, Sicily 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second-round results at the Sicilian International tournament on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat Kris Goosens (Belgium) (Goosens pulled out through injury in first set with Berasategui leading 5-3)</p>
<p>Johan Van Herck (Belgium) beat Galo Blanco (Spain) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Handrek Jan Davids (Netherlands) beat Alex Corretja (Spain) 2-6 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Carlos Moya (Spain) beat Richard Fromberg (Australia) 6-3 7-6 9-7</p>
<p>Jordi Burillo (Spain) beat Tomas Carbonell (Spain) 6-3 6-3</p>
</text>
